  "question": {
    "text": "The number of real solutions of the equation <math><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;are"
  },
