  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is<br /><math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Put <math><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext></math></p><p>Then, the given equation becomes <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Case <math><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo></math> no solution<br />Case <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math><mtext>y</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math><br /><math><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>38</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math> and <math><mn>38</mn></math> i.e. two solutions.</p>"
